            <p class="text-muted small mb-1">Network interfaces belong to a host and hold MAC, IP, and subnet assignments. Supports soft-delete, restore, auto IP assignment, and full-text search.</p>
            <table class="table table-sm table-borderless mb-4 small">
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td style="width:3.5rem"><span class="badge bg-primary font-monospace">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/interfaces</code></td><td class="text-muted">List interfaces (filterable, includes deleted)</td></tr>
